msgid "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"
msgstr "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Mitigation is a package for handling noise in quantum computations. It contains a set of techniques that can be used to build advanced or customized error mitigation pipelines directly with [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Specifically, it contains:\n"
msgstr "Ang Qiskit Mitigation ay isang package para sa paghawak ng noise sa mga quantum computation. Naglalaman ito ng set ng mga technique na puwedeng gamitin para bumuo ng advanced o customized na error mitigation pipeline nang direkta gamit ang [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Partikular, naglalaman ito ng:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementations of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), and Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) with Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) and gate folding amplification methods.\n"
msgstr "Mga implementasyon ng Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), at Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) na may Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) at mga gate folding amplification method.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Functionality for computing a postselected noise channel, from circuit symmetries or spacetime checks, to be used with PEC to reduce sampling overhead [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Functionality para sa pagkalkula ng postselected noise channel, mula sa mga symmetry ng circuit o spacetime check, na gagamitin kasama ng PEC para bawasan ang sampling overhead [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Postselection using non-Markovian error checks to filter corrupted samples out of measured data.\n"
msgstr "Postselection gamit ang non-Markovian error checks para salain palabas ang mga sirang sample mula sa nasukat na data.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for expectation value calculation with advanced error mitigation.\n"
msgstr "Suporta para sa pagkalkula ng expectation value gamit ang advanced error mitigation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
